1
00:07:13,333 --> 00:07:19,333
Believe all ogre again.

2
00:14:26,666 --> 00:14:32,666
Shrek the Musical is a music, comedy, fantasy film
directed by Michael John Warren.

3
00:21:40,000 --> 00:21:46,000
Put out of his swamp solitude by a wicked tyrant's order, grumpy ogre Shrek goes on a journey – accompanied by a
chatterbox donkey – to retrieve a beautiful princess from a tower, unaware that she has secrets all her own.

4
00:28:53,333 --> 00:28:59,333
Shrek, played by Brian d'Arcy James.

5
00:36:06,666 --> 00:36:12,666
Fiona, played by Sutton Foster.

6
00:43:20,000 --> 00:43:26,000
Donkey, played by Daniel Breaker.

7
00:50:33,333 --> 00:50:39,333
Lord Farquaad, played by Christopher Sieber.

8
00:57:46,666 --> 00:57:52,666
Pinocchio / Magic Mirror, played by John Tartaglia.

9
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
Sugar Plum Fairy / Gingy / Dragonette, played by Haven Burton Paschall.

10
01:12:13,333 --> 01:12:19,333
Shrek the Musical is a musical with music by Jeanine Tesori
and book and lyrics by David Lindsay-Abaire.

11
01:19:26,666 --> 01:19:32,666
It is based on the 2001 DreamWorks Animation film Shrek, along with elements of its
sequels: Shrek 2, Shrek Forever After and William Steig's 1990 book Shrek!.

12
01:26:40,000 --> 01:26:46,000
After a trial run in Seattle, the original Broadway production opened in December
2008 and closed after a run of over 12 months in January 2010.

13
01:33:53,333 --> 01:33:59,333
It was followed by a tour of the United States which opened in 2010, and a
re-vamped West End production from June 2011 to February 2013.

14
01:41:06,666 --> 01:41:12,666
A high definition filming of the Broadway production, shot by RadicalMedia, was released on DVD, Blu-ray, and
digital download on October 15, 2013, in North America and December 2, 2013, in the United Kingdom.

15
01:48:20,000 --> 01:48:26,000
The digital version of the film was made available on
Netflix beginning in December 2013.

16
01:55:33,333 --> 01:55:39,333
The film explores themes of friendship, wolf, donkey, feminism, swamp.

17
02:02:46,666 --> 02:02:52,666
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
